<title>USA: US Mint buys 454,000 kg copper at avg $2.6533/kg.</title>
<headline>US Mint buys 454,000 kg copper at avg $2.6533/kg.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Mint said Tuesday that it bought a total of 454,000 kg of surplus copper in four lots from Ore &amp; Chemical Co at an average price of $2.6533 per kg.</p>
<p>The Mint said the total sale price was $1,204,598.20.</p>
